# Outbox

Non-urgent notes, findings and filing requests for the triage thread.

- Each thread keeps one file here: `roadmap/outbox/<thread-slug>.md`.
- One item per bullet. Name the step it touches. When the item carries the owner's grant, name the owner's message.
- Rewrite your own file to hold only what is still unfiled. Pull right before each write.
- Triage reads this folder at each wake, files each item, and removes what it filed.
- Send a message instead only when work is blocked on it, or the owner asked for something to be passed on.
